        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "This is the second time we've used Damasco and let me tell you.  they delivered on time and on budget.  every change was thoroughly documented and agreed upon.  there were no surprises.  I highly recommend Damasco and will use them again for any future projects.  The quality of their work was amazing.  nothing was rushed but they still kept on schedule.  Claude has been doing this for a very long time and shows in the quality of work he puts out. Every contractor says they will treat your house like their own but Claude is the first one I've met who says it and means it.  They are super easy to get in contact with when you need to and take all concerns very seriously.  I cannot recommend them enough.",
        "time": 1746472553,
        "translated": false
